  <item>
    <title>谁在决定中国女孩的脸？| JustPod x 时尚先生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60bee130ec97c268f87cc840</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60bee130ec97c268f87cc840</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Jun 2021 02:35:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>- 本集节目由JustPod与《时尚先生》联合制作 -</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>2017年被称为国产彩妆爆发元年，彼时国家取消了化妆品消费税，彩妆品牌如雨后春笋般生长。如今越来越多的国产美妆品牌掌握了流量玩法、征服了更多脸庞，但当这些国货美妆强调要鼓励女孩们不贴标签敢于做自己时，女孩们的消费行为真的是在做自己吗？</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>在本期播客里，《时尚先生》杂志的编辑李颖迪走访了这条由国货美妆品牌、化妆品代工厂、MCN公司以及无数美妆博主组成的「美丽」生产线，梳理中国女孩的脸究竟是由谁在决定的。</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>- 延伸阅读 -</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wk-ArVy7CtGGXBNKopKmVA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wk-ArVy7CtGGXBNKopKmVA"><span>斩男、甜美、草莓啵啵、又纯又欲 —— 谁在决定中国女孩的脸?</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>- Credits -</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划 程衍樑 熊阿姨</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑 杨一</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人 Xicvona</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音设计 佳杰 啸天</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作总监 王若弛</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>- 收听方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用「</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831"><span>Apple播客</span></a><span>」、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ"><span>Spotify</span></a><span>、小宇宙App或</span><a href="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml" data-url="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml"><span>任意安卓播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《JustPod制造》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/gerenchengzhang/35843396/" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/gerenchengzhang/35843396/"><span>喜马拉雅</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.qingting.fm/channels/351577" data-url="https://www.qingting.fm/channels/351577"><span>蜻蜓FM</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5101706114881541825" data-url="https://m.lizhi.fm/vod/voicesheet/5101706114881541825"><span>荔枝</span></a><span>收听。</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>- 互动方式 -</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7387305292" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7387305292"><span>@JustPod</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7606350368" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7606350368"><span>@先生制造</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：播客一下</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：先生制造</span></p>]]></description>
