  <item>
    <title>LifePod | 7 在美国做刑事记者：乡村视角里的美国故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5ec46d6e418a84a046331423</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">5ec46d6e418a84a046331423</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2020 21:37:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目的嘉宾丹丹前两年在华盛顿旁的一个小镇上当刑事记者，她采访性侵、采访吸毒、采访谋杀、采访事故，也采访小镇上渔民实在简单的普通生活。从乡村视角，她看到了很多我们在主流媒体上所看不到的美国。非常热爱新闻这份职业的她说，她采访的很多故事，好的坏的，都一直跟随着她，时常让她相起。这里面有哪些或黑暗、或惊悚、或伤心、或温暖的故事呢？</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目首发于播客节目“之己 ToYourself”，现由JustPod进一步加工制作，再次分享给大家。</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>【主持、制作人】</span></p><span></span><p><span>钱浚雅（微博：</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1794440555?is_all=1" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1794440555?is_all=1"><span>@JJunya</span></a><span>）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>丹丹</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>【logo设计】五颜六色的大亮哥</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>【剪辑】iAN</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>【制作总监】王若弛</span></p><span></span><p></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>推荐您使用</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831"><span>「苹果播客」</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ"><span>Spotify</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5e7bab45418a84a0460b594c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNmEzZWY0YTJmMmU1MDNjZWI1Mjk4MiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5e7bab45418a84a0460b594c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNmEzZWY0YTJmMmU1MDNjZWI1Mjk4MiJ9"><span>小宇宙App</span></a><span>或</span><a href="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml" data-url="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml"><span>任意安卓播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《LifePod》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/jiaoyu/35843396/" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/jiaoyu/35843396/"><span>喜马拉雅FM</span></a><span>、</span>