    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的嘉宾Viola，对她的第一印象是她非常开放、热情，也非常有艺术细胞。她喜欢画画、跳舞、音乐，总是热情满满地进行着各种新的尝试和探索。前两年，她辞去工作在上海开始了自己的艺术项目“即兴人生”，组织普通人可以参与学习和创造的艺术课程和活动。而去年，她又抱着好奇去尝试做了一次裸模。本以为这是一次猎奇、好玩的经历，但这次尝试却带出了她一些意想不到的感受，比如恐惧，而这也正好加深了她关于艺术的本质以及自己和艺术的关系新的思考。 </span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【主持、制作人】</span></p><span> </span><p><span>钱浚雅（微博：</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1794440555?is_all=1" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1794440555?is_all=1"><span>@JJunya</span></a><span>）&nbsp;</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span> </span><p><span>Viola</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【logo设计】五颜六色的大亮哥</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【后期制作】iAN</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【制作总监】王若弛</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span> </span><p><span>推荐您使用</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831"><span>「苹果播客」</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ"><span>Spotify</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5e7bab45418a84a0460b594c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNmEzZWY0YTJmMmU1MDNjZWI1Mjk4MiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5e7bab45418a84a0460b594c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNmEzZWY0YTJmMmU1MDNjZWI1Mjk4MiJ9"><span>小宇宙App</span></a><span>或</span><a href="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml" data-url="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml"><span>任意安卓播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《LifePod》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/jiaoyu/35843396/" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/jiaoyu/35843396/"><span>喜马拉雅FM</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.qingting.fm/cha