    <title>LifePod | 5 在纽约采访华人按摩女</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5eb1f078418a84a0467764d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">5eb1f078418a84a0467764d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 May 2020 21:05:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上一期我们播出了陈腾在纽约如何成为独立视频导演的故事，也听到她去年有做了一些有意思的报道，比如关于墨西哥大毒枭的故事。除此之外，她去年还做了一个让我感兴趣的报道，是关于纽约唐人街华人按摩女的故事。这篇一万二千多字的报道她前前后后做了三个月。要做这种调查性报道，无论是要找切入的角度、平衡各种观点、还是找愿意接受采访的采访对象，都很不容易。本期就讲了她在这个过程里她遇到了些什么困难，怎么取得突破，以及遇到了什么趣事儿、看到了一个怎样的我们平时接触不到的世界。 </span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【主持、制作人】</span></p><span> </span><p><span>钱浚雅（微博：</span><a href="https://www.weibo.com/u/1794440555?is_all=1" data-url="https://www.weibo.com/u/1794440555?is_all=1"><span>@JJunya</span></a><span>）&nbsp;</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【嘉宾】</span></p><span> </span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;陈腾</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【logo设计】五颜六色的大亮哥</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【后期制作】iAN</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【制作总监】王若弛</span></p><span> </span><p></p><span> </span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span> </span><p><span>推荐您使用</span><a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831" data-url="https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/id1504035831"><span>「苹果播客」</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ" data-url="https://open.spotify.com/show/2dh268J9Yan4lHqQiDYEwQ"><span>Spotify</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5e7bab45418a84a0460b594c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNmEzZWY0YTJmMmU1MDNjZWI1Mjk4MiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/5e7bab45418a84a0460b594c?s=eyJ1IjogIjVlNmEzZWY0YTJmMmU1MDNjZWI1Mjk4MiJ9"><span>小宇宙App</span></a><span>或</span><a href="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml" data-url="https://justpodmedia.com/rss/life-pod.xml"><span>任意安卓播客客户端</span></a><span>订阅收听《LifePod》，也可通过</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/djradio?id=794598404"><span>网易云音乐</span></a><span>、</span><a href="https://www.ximalaya.com/jiaoyu/35843396/" data-url="https://www.ximalaya.com/jiaoyu/35843396/"><span>喜马拉雅FM</span></a><span> 、</span><a href="h